ModMetaData.description:
My own patch collection.
		Main Features:
		- SOS2 support (1.6)
		- Vanilla Nutrient Paste Expanded Support (feat. @Matt-MentTao)
		- Repeatable Research
		QoL Features:
		- Auto forbid rotted meat & rotten mush outside home area;
		- Set threshold for Deep Drill resources;
		- Select sand or rubble as Deep Drill resources after research;
		- Remove monument quest completely;
		- ... and more!
		Cross-mod Features:
		- Seed please: show skill & tech requirement on seed info tab;
